 "about": "What each effect on a player (or on the boss) is worth to that player's hits, as a multiplier minus one: a hit under effects worth v1, v2 ... was 1/((1+v1)(1+v2)...) without them, and the difference is shared among the casters in proportion to log(1+v). The player's own effects take their share too (it stays with him). Matched fight by fight to the rDPS of the meters players compare against (November 2026); effects not yet seen in such a fight carry the value of their damage stats in the client's tables (amplification + damage ratio, half the critical damage and hard-hit rates; a boss's damage resistance taken down). Regenerated from new fights as they come in.",
